{"id": "DaODL56qh4_", "title": "Video by poppulsedaily", "description": "This amusing video captures a man and a woman in an apartment building demonstrating an unusual way to handle the summer heat. On an upper floor balcony, a man is relaxing in a chair reading a newspaper right next to a massive blue inflatable pool filled with water. The water continuously overflows from his balcony, creating a steady waterfall that pours directly onto the apartment below. On the lower balcony, a woman trying to hang her laundry out to dry is completely drenched by the falling water. The clip highlights how the rising cost of living has forced people to find highly creative but highly inconvenient alternatives to traditional summer vacations when traveling becomes unaffordable.", "channel": "poppulsedaily", "uploader_id": "79948585109", "uploader": "Pop Culture 🍿", "timestamp": 1782842980, "like_count": 276569, "comment_count": 358, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1338146737738507a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 53.839, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-sin2-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMHPmvi0_zj0lsuwYagE1v7fJmoe1N8VakeFfAC1dVFUcb3bHvyaO19S_YCk7eSqiY_XveFmGocZFDg-RTvPvT_Xqg4KGvnBy6vn0U.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=28usYeBqksAQ7kNvwGmcJrw&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=TqTKEJ_kuEzZ8CToXE_m-Q&_nc_ss=7da8c&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQDHjniNO6jSOBCeTYjNDOonPDnivWplCmRRlR1RT-ePUw&oe=6A6A3554", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 53.839, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language"